   "titulo": "Courtesy Imperative",
   "texto": [
    "To address a person with courtesy, use forms such as **Fale** (speak), **Espere** (wait), **Venha** (come) and **Diga** (say).",
    "With **-ar**, it ends in **-e**: **falar → fale**. With many verbs in **-er/-ir**, it ends in **-a**: **comer → coma**, **abrir → abra**. The verb usually concords in third person."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Common",
   "texto": [
    "**Ser → seja**, **ir → vá**, **vir → venha**, **dizer → diga**.",
    "**Vá** is written with tilde; it learns the complete form **ir → vá**. For the request to sound polite, you can add **por favor** or **se faz favor**."
   ]
